WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.160 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 24=

01:38.000 --> 01:40.800
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

01:42.240 --> 01:43.440
It's a bundle of Wangyou grass.

01:44.080 --> 01:45.200
Mr. Zhao

01:45.320 --> 01:46.760
was worried you might be anxious.

01:47.360 --> 01:48.840
That's why he didn't deliver it himself.

01:50.080 --> 01:51.400
He is still upset.

01:51.400 --> 01:52.280
If that's the case,

01:54.439 --> 01:56.159
I'll do as he said.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.640
I'll worry less

01:58.439 --> 01:59.840
and stop waiting like an idiot.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.280
Zheng San said

02:01.879 --> 02:02.799
Mr. Zhao

02:02.799 --> 02:04.280
has gone to find
the Seventh Young Master Fu

02:04.280 --> 02:05.439
to testify on his behalf.

02:06.040 --> 02:06.760
Miss Xie,

02:07.439 --> 02:08.639
please set your mind at ease.

02:10.520 --> 02:11.680
Tingzhuo?

02:15.000 --> 02:16.960
It's been so long since we last saw him.

02:18.280 --> 02:19.439
I wonder

02:20.360 --> 02:22.240
how he will view this matter.

02:30.759 --> 02:32.039
I heard from my wife

02:32.840 --> 02:33.680
that all these years,

02:34.879 --> 02:36.400
you've taken good care of Tingyun.

02:38.439 --> 02:39.759
I am grateful for that.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.759
It's not that

02:41.879 --> 02:43.520
I took care of her.

02:45.240 --> 02:47.159
We've stood by

02:48.039 --> 02:49.439
and cared for each other.

02:50.599 --> 02:51.080
Here.

02:53.680 --> 02:54.520
Mr. Zhao.

02:55.439 --> 02:57.759
I know why you asked to see me today.

02:59.000 --> 03:00.319
But my father's command
cannot be defied.

03:00.800 --> 03:01.800
You and Tingyun,

03:02.680 --> 03:03.120
I...

03:06.000 --> 03:06.879
I cannot help you.

03:12.199 --> 03:13.439
I understand your position.

03:14.439 --> 03:15.599
Today's meeting

03:18.280 --> 03:19.479
is simply for old times' sake.

03:23.039 --> 03:23.479
Come, let's drink.

03:30.639 --> 03:31.680
I was born in the Fu family,

03:31.680 --> 03:32.560
raised in the Fu family,

03:32.560 --> 03:33.719
and bound by the Fu family.

03:34.159 --> 03:35.560
When calamity struck Tingyun,

03:36.199 --> 03:38.080
she was fortunate to escape this cage.

03:39.120 --> 03:40.639
But what I carry on my shoulders

03:41.360 --> 03:43.000
are these heavy shackles.

03:44.000 --> 03:45.439
The weight of filial piety alone

03:46.560 --> 03:48.039
suffocates me.

03:49.879 --> 03:50.919
You can see for yourself.

03:51.759 --> 03:53.120
If the men of the Fu family

03:53.680 --> 03:55.919
have no achievements
in officialdom or scholarship,

03:57.680 --> 03:58.560
then reputation

04:00.319 --> 04:01.439
becomes even more important.

04:02.199 --> 04:03.159
In that case,

04:05.719 --> 04:06.879
I have nothing more to say.

04:08.759 --> 04:09.800
Is there anything

04:11.439 --> 04:12.520
you want me to tell her?

04:22.480 --> 04:23.560
This was carved to congratulate Tingyun

04:23.560 --> 04:25.279
on her wedding at that time.

04:26.240 --> 04:27.839
But she left home in such a hurry

04:29.800 --> 04:30.920
that she couldn't take it with her.

04:32.800 --> 04:34.360
Now is the perfect time

04:35.360 --> 04:36.199
to give it to her

04:37.240 --> 04:38.040
through you.

04:49.240 --> 04:51.120
Even if you won't help me today,

04:53.079 --> 04:55.519
I'll still see you as my brother-in-law.

04:56.480 --> 04:57.439
I hope that one day,

04:58.800 --> 05:00.879
when I properly marry Tingyun,

05:02.959 --> 05:04.199
you will come and drink with us.

05:06.399 --> 05:06.959
Alright.

05:09.319 --> 05:10.120
Seventh Young Master.

05:11.480 --> 05:12.360
There's something

05:13.680 --> 05:14.920
I'd like to pass on for her.

05:16.360 --> 05:17.120
Please.

05:17.600 --> 05:19.040
What you lose in one place,

05:21.120 --> 05:22.319
you gain in another.

05:23.560 --> 05:24.759
As long as you live

05:25.399 --> 05:27.040
and the fire in your heart does not die,

05:27.600 --> 05:28.879
whether in politics

05:32.199 --> 05:33.399
or in the academy,

05:36.920 --> 05:39.319
sooner or later,
you'll have a bright future.

05:46.199 --> 05:46.959
Rest assured.

05:47.879 --> 05:48.800
She and I

05:50.439 --> 05:51.879
have done nothing wrong.

05:53.319 --> 05:54.399
We can weather any storm.

05:55.600 --> 05:56.879
Fifth Master

05:58.160 --> 05:59.360
can't touch us.

06:01.639 --> 06:02.240
Good.

06:04.040 --> 06:04.519
Come on.

06:19.319 --> 06:20.759
My father's command cannot be defied.

06:21.120 --> 06:22.040
What happened?

06:22.399 --> 06:23.399
He's so drunk.

06:23.639 --> 06:24.480
Help him to bed.

06:26.000 --> 06:26.959
Get some hot water.

06:27.160 --> 06:27.680
Yes.

06:29.040 --> 06:29.519
Father...

06:30.279 --> 06:31.920
My father's command cannot be defied.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.800
Serving my in-laws

06:35.920 --> 06:36.959
and now a drunkard.

06:38.480 --> 06:39.560
Marrying a beggar

06:39.920 --> 06:40.879
would be better

06:40.879 --> 06:42.160
than a spineless coward.

06:43.079 --> 06:43.680
Ting...

06:44.399 --> 06:45.240
Tingyun.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.279
I want to say something to you.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.680
I've let you down.

06:53.079 --> 06:54.639
I want to help you too.

06:55.519 --> 06:56.839
But I cannot...

06:59.040 --> 07:01.600
I cannot wrong your sister-in-law.

07:02.480 --> 07:03.040
I...

07:03.680 --> 07:05.959
I cannot make my mark
in the imperial exams.

07:06.079 --> 07:07.199
I don't deserve it.

07:07.199 --> 07:08.839
If I were to enter officialdom,

07:08.839 --> 07:10.600
wouldn't I be following Father's path,

07:11.040 --> 07:13.639
climbing over the chastity arches

07:13.639 --> 07:14.920
of the women of the Fu family?

07:15.480 --> 07:17.000
But if I help you,

07:17.920 --> 07:21.160
then I break the Fu family's banner
of filial piety.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.639
What about your sister-in-law?

07:24.160 --> 07:25.560
She and the children,

07:26.000 --> 07:28.800
how can they ever hold their heads up?

07:29.920 --> 07:31.360
I can't move forward.

07:32.920 --> 07:34.040
I can't step back.

07:38.959 --> 07:41.319
I am so torn.

07:45.360 --> 07:46.600
Forgive me.

07:47.279 --> 07:49.199
Forgive me.

08:01.199 --> 08:02.199
Has he been

08:03.480 --> 08:05.120
failing the exams on purpose?

08:13.199 --> 08:14.399
The 6th year of the Hongzhi era,

08:14.639 --> 08:15.600
5th month, 22nd day.

08:15.959 --> 08:17.680
The case of the Fu family servant Li
suing her master

08:17.759 --> 08:19.120
is now formally convened.

08:23.839 --> 08:25.240
The plaintiff, servant woman Li,

08:25.439 --> 08:26.879
was beaten to death in court.

08:27.120 --> 08:27.839
I

08:27.839 --> 08:28.839
shall present this petition
on her behalf.

08:29.480 --> 08:30.639
Here is the written complaint.

08:31.040 --> 08:32.720
Commander Zhao,
you hold the fourth rank.

08:32.799 --> 08:33.480
No need to kneel.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.519
I, Xie,

08:38.639 --> 08:39.720
pay my respects to you, My Lord.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.639
I, Zhao Ling,

08:43.720 --> 08:44.679
pay my respects to you, My Lord.

08:44.879 --> 08:45.919
The plaintiff, Li,

08:46.159 --> 08:46.799
charges

08:46.799 --> 08:47.720
that Fu Tingyun

08:47.960 --> 08:49.279
eloped and disgraced the family,

08:49.519 --> 08:50.639
causing her grandmother's death.

08:51.159 --> 08:52.440
Under our dynasty's law,

08:52.799 --> 08:53.399
this is

08:53.519 --> 08:54.600
a grave crime of unfilial conduct.

08:54.919 --> 08:55.840
Zhao Ling,

08:56.440 --> 08:58.240
currently an Assistant Commander
of the Capital Guard,

08:58.559 --> 08:59.879
is charged with abducting
a virtuous woman

09:00.159 --> 09:01.320
and causing the death of her kin.

09:01.440 --> 09:02.279
Do the two of you

09:02.720 --> 09:03.679
plead guilty?

09:03.879 --> 09:04.840
I do not.

09:04.840 --> 09:05.919
I do not.

09:06.399 --> 09:07.559
Call the plaintiff's witness.

09:12.919 --> 09:13.600
My Lord.

09:14.000 --> 09:14.759
I am

09:15.000 --> 09:16.879
the son of Li's former master.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.240
I come from the Fu family of Huaying.

09:19.679 --> 09:20.519
I was once

09:20.759 --> 09:22.320
a fifth-rank civil official.

09:22.799 --> 09:23.840
Today, I come before you

09:24.080 --> 09:25.320
at great personal cost

09:26.159 --> 09:27.519
to air our family's shame.

09:28.120 --> 09:30.600
All because this unfilial daughter,
Fu Tingyun,

09:30.600 --> 09:31.879
drove her grandmother to her death

09:32.320 --> 09:33.519
through her defiant behavior.

09:34.360 --> 09:35.440
I implore you to investigate, My Lord,

09:35.440 --> 09:36.480
to bring this wayward daughter back,

09:36.879 --> 09:38.759
and punish Zhao Ling severely,

09:39.039 --> 09:40.320
so my mother's soul may finally rest.

09:41.080 --> 09:41.919
Defendant,

09:42.240 --> 09:43.240
do you have anything to say?

09:44.840 --> 09:45.799
My Lord, please hear my plea.

09:46.279 --> 09:48.120
When I was in the Fu family,

09:48.559 --> 09:50.320
I was falsely accused of adultery.

09:50.559 --> 09:51.919
The Fu family nearly

09:52.000 --> 09:53.279
executed me without trial.

09:54.639 --> 09:57.200
Thankfully, my mother secretly entrusted
Commander Zhao to save me.

10:00.919 --> 10:02.879
This jade bracelet,
an heirloom of the Xie family,

10:03.240 --> 10:04.240
was given to me

10:04.240 --> 10:05.519
by my mother as a betrothal token,

10:05.679 --> 10:07.039
placed into my own hands.

10:07.279 --> 10:08.360
After I was rescued,

10:08.440 --> 10:09.759
I took the surname Xie.

10:10.120 --> 10:11.159
If you doubt me, My Lord,

10:11.440 --> 10:12.360
you may inspect

10:12.519 --> 10:14.399
the records of the Huaying county yamen.

10:14.519 --> 10:16.200
They clearly show

10:16.399 --> 10:18.039
that I was recorded as deceased.

10:18.240 --> 10:19.519
If you still have doubts,

10:20.039 --> 10:21.159
I can call a witness,

10:21.559 --> 10:22.759
Hanyan, to the stand.

10:24.240 --> 10:26.559
She was the personal maid
of my sister-in-law, Zuo.

10:26.759 --> 10:28.039
She knows the inner affairs

10:28.360 --> 10:29.440
of the Fu family well.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.679
Call the defendant's witness.

10:36.799 --> 10:37.399
Hanyan.

10:38.279 --> 10:39.919
You are a former servant
of the Fu family.

10:40.159 --> 10:41.519
You should know what to say

10:41.519 --> 10:42.399
and what to leave unsaid.

10:44.559 --> 10:45.879
Fifth Master, you may have forgotten,

10:46.440 --> 10:48.559
though my former mistress held a grudge
against Ninth Young Lady,

10:49.000 --> 10:50.879
she resented the Fu family's coldness
even more.

10:51.639 --> 10:52.440
My Lord,

10:53.120 --> 10:54.320
I can testify

10:54.440 --> 10:56.440
that everything Ninth Young Lady said
is true.

10:56.600 --> 10:59.039
When she left the Fu family
with Commander Zhao that year,

10:59.159 --> 11:00.919
it was an act of survival
in desperate times.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.440
I saw it with my own eyes.

11:02.440 --> 11:04.159
Madam Zuo of the Fu family
conspired with servants

11:04.279 --> 11:05.679
to frame Ninth Young Lady for adultery.

11:05.799 --> 11:07.879
The Old Madam Fu, for the sake
of a few chastity memorial arches,

11:07.879 --> 11:08.960
turned her back on family.

11:09.440 --> 11:11.279
Commander Zhao was entrusted
by the Fifth Madam

11:11.639 --> 11:13.519
to take Ninth Young Lady out of Huaying.

11:13.759 --> 11:15.120
That was a life-saving act.

11:15.320 --> 11:17.200
It was not an illicit elopement.

11:22.280 --> 11:25.560
(Indenture Contract)

11:40.559 --> 11:41.879
What time is it now?

11:48.200 --> 11:48.840
Oh no.

11:49.840 --> 11:51.080
I wonder how the trial is going.

11:56.559 --> 11:57.279
Mother?

12:02.000 --> 12:02.600
Mother.

12:07.159 --> 12:08.200
It was my daughter-in-law

12:08.200 --> 12:09.919
who dismissed the servants

12:10.120 --> 12:11.600
and brought me out here.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.240
I plan to go

12:13.240 --> 12:14.320
to Chengqian Prefectural Yamen

12:14.559 --> 12:15.840
and help your sister.

12:17.320 --> 12:18.759
Will you help me?

12:19.679 --> 12:20.480
Mother,

12:20.879 --> 12:22.440
are you going to confront Father
in court?

12:25.399 --> 12:26.120
My husband,

12:26.679 --> 12:28.039
I know you want to go too.

12:29.519 --> 12:30.600
I used to think

12:31.279 --> 12:32.759
you were shallow in learning,

12:32.759 --> 12:34.080
lacking ambition,

12:34.720 --> 12:35.960
and submissive to Father

12:35.960 --> 12:36.600
in blind filial piety,

12:36.600 --> 12:37.679
unable to tell right from wrong.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.440
But yesterday,

12:40.440 --> 12:42.279
when I heard your drunken ramblings,

12:42.440 --> 12:44.639
I realized you have your own pain too.

12:46.639 --> 12:48.120
If I can help you find your way,

12:49.000 --> 12:51.600
you would surely be
the most principled man in the world.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.559
What

12:54.279 --> 12:55.320
do you mean?

12:56.879 --> 12:57.840
I want to ask you.

12:59.840 --> 13:02.360
I don't need my husband
to rise above others.

13:03.039 --> 13:03.919
I only ask that he be

13:03.919 --> 13:05.399
an ordinary man
without great achievements,

13:06.200 --> 13:07.639
but with high moral character,

13:07.639 --> 13:08.559
and an open heart.

13:08.559 --> 13:09.519
Can you be that kind of man?

13:10.399 --> 13:11.399
If you agree,

13:11.879 --> 13:13.000
I promise you

13:13.840 --> 13:15.879
that I will never seek wealth or status.

13:16.840 --> 13:17.919
I will not push you to achieve.

13:17.919 --> 13:19.039
I will only raise our children.

13:19.320 --> 13:20.799
You don't need the exams anymore.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.559
Come back to my hometown with me.

13:22.679 --> 13:23.759
Work under my father

13:23.759 --> 13:25.000
as a modest clerk.

13:25.000 --> 13:25.919
Never again rely on the Fu family's

13:25.919 --> 13:27.360
wealth or reputation.

13:28.320 --> 13:29.480
We two,

13:29.480 --> 13:30.559
with clear consciences,

13:31.080 --> 13:33.519
will never again be bound
by any memorial arch.

13:35.879 --> 13:37.200
I will honor my mother-in-law.

13:38.080 --> 13:39.240
You honor your father-in-law.

13:41.120 --> 13:41.919
In the future,

13:42.519 --> 13:45.039
whether our children honor us or not,

13:45.559 --> 13:46.639
we will not force it.

13:47.200 --> 13:47.960
What do you say?

13:51.080 --> 13:52.399
But when you agreed to marry me,

13:52.960 --> 13:54.120
it was for my family's
scholarly reputation

13:54.240 --> 13:55.200
and status.

13:55.279 --> 13:55.639
I...

13:57.000 --> 13:58.679
Then you underestimate me.

14:00.399 --> 14:01.320
I married

14:02.480 --> 14:03.759
the man himself,

14:05.120 --> 14:06.399
not his birth.

14:12.120 --> 14:13.200
Cutting flesh to heal a parent.

14:13.200 --> 14:14.440
Cutting flesh to heal a parent.

14:14.639 --> 14:15.159
Zhuang.

14:15.600 --> 14:16.159
Zhuang.

14:16.519 --> 14:16.960
Be good.

14:18.279 --> 14:18.960
Go play outside.

14:19.639 --> 14:20.360
Let's go.

14:20.360 --> 14:21.000
Alright.

14:36.360 --> 14:37.879
My mother's coffin

14:39.759 --> 14:41.919
has never been returned to her homeland.

14:42.360 --> 14:44.840
She is buried at Phoenix Ridge
on the outskirts of the capital.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.679
I built a hut and observed mourning,

14:47.919 --> 14:50.759
eating only vegetarian food
and fasting for seven years.

14:51.120 --> 14:53.279
I finally waited for Zhao Ling
to return to the capital.

14:53.639 --> 14:55.600
I want to demand justice from him.

14:55.919 --> 14:57.240
But this man

14:57.240 --> 14:58.519
is high in rank and power,

14:59.200 --> 15:00.799
while I am of low standing
and weak voice.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.080
Yet heaven's justice is clear.

15:03.480 --> 15:04.799
I beg Your Lordship to see the truth.

15:05.080 --> 15:06.639
What do you have to say for yourself?

15:07.080 --> 15:09.200
I left Huaying in the 5th month

15:09.200 --> 15:10.120
of the 22nd year of Dacheng.

15:10.480 --> 15:12.840
Old Madam Fu passed away
in the 9th month of the same year.

15:13.480 --> 15:15.080
That is over four months apart.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.320
In terms of timing,

15:17.120 --> 15:18.320
it is hardly proof, is it?

15:20.200 --> 15:22.080
My mother fell ill from grief
in the 5th month.

15:23.039 --> 15:24.320
I have the medical records here.

15:24.919 --> 15:26.960
You two ungrateful, unfilial wretches.

15:27.279 --> 15:28.519
You drove your grandmother to her death

15:28.519 --> 15:29.639
(Tongue: pale red, edges reddened)
and defied your elders.

15:29.639 --> 15:29.960
(Liver-spleen disharmony)

15:30.039 --> 15:30.919
One an eloped woman,

15:31.120 --> 15:32.200
the other a libertine.

15:32.960 --> 15:34.120
He is no libertine.

15:34.200 --> 15:35.600
Nor is she an eloped woman.

15:36.480 --> 15:37.559
I can testify.

15:43.440 --> 15:44.159
Mother.

15:45.039 --> 15:45.840
Tingzhuo.

15:53.879 --> 15:54.840
I can testify.

15:55.159 --> 15:56.600
When my mother-in-law
was on her deathbed,

15:56.919 --> 15:58.159
her mind was clear

15:58.480 --> 16:00.080
and she bore no resentment.

16:00.960 --> 16:02.639
At that time,
the Eldest Master of the Fu family

16:02.639 --> 16:04.759
was entangled in the Huaying salt case.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.399
My mother-in-law

16:06.399 --> 16:08.399
was worn down
by the careers of her two sons.

16:08.519 --> 16:09.759
That is what led to her passing.

16:10.720 --> 16:13.600
That gave Fifth Master the chance
to observe mourning.

16:13.840 --> 16:15.799
But he was unwilling
to leave the capital.

16:16.279 --> 16:18.120
To be ready to return to office
at any time,

16:18.559 --> 16:21.000
he had his mother's coffin brought back

16:21.360 --> 16:22.720
and built a hut to mourn.

16:23.039 --> 16:24.240
You are just a woman...

16:24.440 --> 16:25.879
My daughter has been wronged.

16:26.480 --> 16:28.000
She is utterly innocent.

16:28.879 --> 16:30.279
If you were truly filial,

16:31.279 --> 16:33.559
you should have returned
your mother's coffin

16:34.440 --> 16:36.159
to the ancestral graves in Huaying.

16:36.519 --> 16:37.919
You are just a woman.

16:38.320 --> 16:40.080
What right do you have to speak
in the Fu family?

16:41.000 --> 16:41.480
My Lord,

16:42.200 --> 16:43.759
I am the eldest son
of the fifth branch of the Fu family.

16:44.240 --> 16:45.879
I was brought up by my grandmother.

16:46.399 --> 16:47.960
I stake my life and honor

16:48.279 --> 16:49.240
on the truth

16:49.360 --> 16:50.279
of my mother's words.

16:50.799 --> 16:51.759
As a son,

16:53.279 --> 16:54.679
I cannot speak against my father.

16:55.279 --> 16:57.240
But I will not stand by
while my sister is wronged.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.200
I beg Your Lordship to see the truth.

16:59.759 --> 17:01.039
This case has been investigated.

17:01.279 --> 17:01.960
Fifth Master Fu

17:02.120 --> 17:03.600
falsely accused a court official.

17:03.840 --> 17:05.359
By law, he should be severely punished.

17:05.839 --> 17:07.200
But in consideration
of family grievances,

17:07.200 --> 17:08.279
I shall show him leniency.

17:08.960 --> 17:09.640
Commander Zhao

17:09.640 --> 17:10.440
and Miss Xie

17:10.680 --> 17:12.039
did not elope.

17:12.039 --> 17:13.039
They are cleared of all charges.

17:15.160 --> 17:15.839
Fine.

17:15.839 --> 17:16.960
You're quite something.

17:17.279 --> 17:18.680
We'll settle this at home.

17:19.480 --> 17:20.119
Mother.

17:22.039 --> 17:22.720
It's alright.

17:23.079 --> 17:24.559
I have your brother to protect me.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.599
Take this chance to have Zhao Ling

17:29.599 --> 17:30.839
come propose soon

17:31.319 --> 17:32.839
and make the marriage official.

17:33.160 --> 17:33.799
Go now.

17:36.319 --> 17:37.240
Go, I dare you.

17:37.759 --> 17:39.640
Let's see who dares to set foot
in my house!

17:46.599 --> 17:47.920
If you are willing,

17:48.880 --> 17:50.200
I will go today.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.480
Just say the word.

17:54.039 --> 17:55.559
Isn't it that you thought

17:57.279 --> 17:58.799
I was inconsiderate

17:59.279 --> 18:00.799
and unwilling to stand by you?

18:02.400 --> 18:05.119
Why are you still upset
about the wedding?

18:07.559 --> 18:08.319
Mr. Zhao,

18:11.240 --> 18:12.640
I am willing.

18:30.079 --> 18:30.680
I...

18:35.319 --> 18:36.880
I will go prepare the betrothal gifts.

18:37.000 --> 18:41.080
(Chengqian Prefectural Yamen)

18:47.360 --> 18:49.880
(Xie Residence)

18:57.160 --> 19:01.360
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

19:17.799 --> 19:18.880
All rites are prepared.

19:21.880 --> 19:22.640
Set out.

20:07.640 --> 20:09.039
I have come today

20:09.680 --> 20:11.039
to present the betrothal gifts.

20:11.680 --> 20:12.960
I have prepared
ten bolts of cloud brocade,

20:13.079 --> 20:14.480
two sets of gold headpieces,

20:15.000 --> 20:16.559
and a bushel of pearls
from the Eastern Sea.

20:17.359 --> 20:18.640
Please, Fifth Madam, have a look.

20:19.599 --> 20:21.480
I also request the Ninth Young Lady's
Eight-Character Slip

20:21.640 --> 20:22.960
to unite our two families.

20:30.319 --> 20:31.319
Commander Zhao,

20:31.680 --> 20:32.759
what you just said

20:32.759 --> 20:34.680
sounds reasonable enough.

20:35.039 --> 20:36.759
But let me ask you this.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.039
Since you know

20:38.119 --> 20:39.039
that marriage

20:39.279 --> 20:40.799
requires the parents' blessing,

20:41.279 --> 20:43.799
when you took Tingyun from Huaying,

20:43.960 --> 20:45.319
then the two of you

20:45.319 --> 20:47.079
were no better than an eloped woman
and a libertine.

20:47.799 --> 20:49.160
Was that proper?

20:53.079 --> 20:54.200
In urgent times, one must adapt.

20:54.880 --> 20:56.160
To save Ninth Young Lady from peril,

20:56.680 --> 20:57.960
I could not stand on ceremony.

20:58.640 --> 21:00.039
Standing on ceremony is not optional.

21:00.880 --> 21:02.680
Outside the Fu family ancestral hall

21:02.759 --> 21:04.920
stand three chastity memorial arches.

21:05.759 --> 21:06.920
You want the Eight-Character Slip?

21:07.640 --> 21:10.400
Not unless the ancestral hall's plaque
crashes down.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.519
These betrothal gifts

21:16.640 --> 21:18.480
were meant for Fifth Madam.

21:18.759 --> 21:20.480
Since Fifth Madam is unavailable...

21:20.599 --> 21:22.279
There is no Fifth Madam here.

21:22.279 --> 21:23.079
There is only

21:23.079 --> 21:24.759
Madam Xie.

21:26.480 --> 21:28.319
You bring all these gifts,

21:29.119 --> 21:30.200
and you think

21:30.200 --> 21:32.240
I should greet you with a smile?

21:33.160 --> 21:34.519
You look down on me?

21:34.680 --> 21:35.720
Listen to me.

21:36.400 --> 21:38.240
No matter how poor I am,

21:38.359 --> 21:40.519
I am still the head of the Fu family.

21:40.519 --> 21:41.079
Guards,

21:41.480 --> 21:42.519
arm yourselves.

21:42.519 --> 21:43.400
If he dares step inside,

21:43.400 --> 21:44.279
drive him out.

21:53.319 --> 21:54.680
I am appointed by His Majesty

21:54.680 --> 21:56.119
as Assistant Commander
of the Capital Guard,

21:59.240 --> 22:01.160
and concurrently
an Assistant Censor-in-Chief.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.400
Are you all planning

22:04.000 --> 22:05.799
to assault a court official?

22:09.160 --> 22:10.240
Listen carefully.

22:10.759 --> 22:12.400
Shut the doors in a moment.

22:12.920 --> 22:14.519
If he tries to force his way in,

22:15.240 --> 22:16.119
drive him out!

22:25.960 --> 22:26.640
Mr. Zhao.

22:33.440 --> 22:34.279
Commander Zhao.

22:37.160 --> 22:38.319
Madam knows you have come.

22:38.319 --> 22:39.400
She is deeply worried.

22:39.880 --> 22:41.240
She sent me to relay a message.

22:41.319 --> 22:42.519
She fears this may escalate.

22:42.640 --> 22:44.079
She asks you to bear with it for now

22:44.079 --> 22:45.640
and wait outside for her instructions.

22:50.279 --> 22:51.279
Fifth Madam,

22:51.640 --> 22:52.680
I, your son-in-law Zhao Ling,

22:52.799 --> 22:53.720
humbly await your guidance.

22:54.559 --> 22:55.599
My good son.

22:56.960 --> 22:58.359
You have my blessing

22:59.359 --> 23:00.680
to marry Tingyun.

23:01.640 --> 23:03.920
Tingyun is my own flesh and blood.

23:04.359 --> 23:06.519
How can I stand by while she is bullied

23:06.519 --> 23:07.680
and her fate is ruined?

23:09.200 --> 23:11.440
I have prepared another dowry for her,

23:11.880 --> 23:13.240
entrusted to the Xie's shop.

23:13.960 --> 23:15.000
On the wedding day,

23:15.319 --> 23:16.799
she will depart from there.

23:17.160 --> 23:19.000
Remember her Eight-Character Slip well.

23:22.119 --> 23:22.680
Yes.

23:35.000 --> 23:36.079
Fu Tingyun.

23:36.599 --> 23:37.880
Born in the fifth year of Dacheng,

23:38.359 --> 23:40.599
on the 18th day of the 4th month,
at the hour of Hai.

23:42.119 --> 23:43.599
A blessed union.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.960
Bound as one forever.

23:46.839 --> 23:48.279
A match made in heaven.

23:49.000 --> 23:50.559
Together through a hundred years.

23:51.359 --> 23:53.039
May their virtue flourish
for a thousand years,

23:53.759 --> 23:56.279
and their harmony last
a hundred springs.

24:07.839 --> 24:09.400
I swear on my life

24:09.759 --> 24:11.000
that I will never betray her.

24:13.599 --> 24:14.319
Zhao Ling!

24:14.599 --> 24:15.599
Someone is coming.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.960
Commander Zhao, you must leave now.

24:19.880 --> 24:20.480
Well, well, well.

24:21.279 --> 24:24.000
You traitor.
How dare you betray your master?

24:24.119 --> 24:25.440
I'll beat you to death!

24:25.839 --> 24:27.720
I'm sorry, Master!

24:28.079 --> 24:28.720
Zhao Ling!

24:28.799 --> 24:29.319
You...

24:29.319 --> 24:29.960
Zhao Ling.

24:30.599 --> 24:31.759
Go back.

24:32.319 --> 24:33.680
For the sake of his reputation,

24:33.880 --> 24:35.119
he won't dare harm me.

24:35.119 --> 24:35.960
Shut up!

24:36.279 --> 24:38.599
You, a fourth-rank official,
dare break the very laws you enforce.

24:38.599 --> 24:39.440
You disgrace your office

24:39.440 --> 24:40.319
by trespassing into a private residence.

24:40.319 --> 24:41.319
I will report this to the court.

24:41.319 --> 24:42.319
You'll regret it.

24:43.000 --> 24:43.680
And you,

24:43.680 --> 24:44.680
you vile woman.

24:45.400 --> 24:47.599
You dared to give him
her ‌Eight-Character Slip.

24:48.079 --> 24:49.400
I'll beat you to death!

24:50.599 --> 24:53.000
Do you even remember
Tingyun's birth date?

24:55.039 --> 24:57.000
Why should I remember
that unfilial daughter's birth date?

24:57.000 --> 24:58.279
If you don't know her birth date,

24:58.960 --> 25:00.880
you cannot produce
an ‌Eight-Character Slip.

25:01.680 --> 25:02.839
You only think of

25:03.440 --> 25:04.480
parental authority

25:04.920 --> 25:06.359
and using that to control Zhao Ling.

25:06.920 --> 25:07.920
But you forgot

25:08.240 --> 25:10.119
that on the children's
Eight-Character Marriage Slip,

25:10.839 --> 25:13.160
the most important thing
is the parents' blessing.

25:14.400 --> 25:16.160
What does "a parent's command"
truly mean?

25:17.160 --> 25:19.640
It means I bless my children
and wish them happiness,

25:19.960 --> 25:22.960
not that their happiness requires
my permission.

25:24.640 --> 25:26.039
I am her mother.

25:26.720 --> 25:28.680
When I give you
her ‌Eight-Character Slip,

25:29.440 --> 25:31.200
that is my blessing.

25:36.279 --> 25:37.160
Chuan, Biao.

25:37.480 --> 25:37.920
- Yes.
- Yes.

25:40.079 --> 25:40.920
Stay here.

25:41.319 --> 25:42.240
Protect my mother-in-law.

25:42.240 --> 25:42.799
- Yes!
- Yes!

26:04.280 --> 26:06.160
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

26:06.160 --> 26:08.160
Once Mr. Zhao gets past this hurdle,

26:09.039 --> 26:10.400
there will be one less obstacle

26:11.279 --> 26:13.039
between the two of you.

26:19.200 --> 26:20.079
Sanniang,

26:21.640 --> 26:23.920
when you and Zheng San got married,

26:26.079 --> 26:27.319
were you ever afraid?

26:29.319 --> 26:31.440
Why would I be afraid of that big oaf?

26:31.720 --> 26:32.799
If he's not afraid of me,

26:33.000 --> 26:34.200
he should count himself lucky.

26:37.359 --> 26:38.599
I keep thinking,

26:40.640 --> 26:42.839
am I being too headstrong?

26:44.440 --> 26:45.960
Why is it that since returning
to the capital,

26:46.799 --> 26:48.720
I keep finding myself arguing

26:49.039 --> 26:50.519
with Mr. Zhao over things?

26:51.680 --> 26:53.039
Don't overthink it.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.440
Let's go inside.

27:00.640 --> 27:02.460
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

27:10.120 --> 27:11.400
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

27:28.840 --> 27:33.519
♪Once a bird in a cage,
longing for the boundless sky♪

27:33.519 --> 27:34.119
Tingyun.

27:35.360 --> 27:40.960
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

27:41.840 --> 27:47.440
♪Though I rack my brain with care,
fate still sways me here and there♪

27:48.120 --> 27:53.800
♪Deep in the night, dreams stretch long,
silent and forlorn♪

27:54.640 --> 28:00.240
♪Once a bird among the clouds,
now fallen into the mortal world♪

28:01.440 --> 28:02.319
Fifth Madam said,

28:03.200 --> 28:04.200
parental command

28:05.440 --> 28:07.160
is to bless their children to live well,

28:08.720 --> 28:10.480
not to allow them to live well.

28:11.759 --> 28:12.839
Fifth Master is harsh.

28:13.400 --> 28:14.519
I'm a little worried

28:15.440 --> 28:16.920
about Fifth Madam's future.

28:21.119 --> 28:22.880
His only claim to standing now

28:24.680 --> 28:26.400
is the word "filial piety."

28:27.559 --> 28:29.240
If I cut off his retreat,

28:30.920 --> 28:32.319
then Mother should be able

28:33.640 --> 28:35.079
to live a better life.

28:37.319 --> 28:39.359
So I must tear down his grass hut.

28:41.519 --> 28:43.680
Mother said something wise today.

28:44.480 --> 28:45.839
True filial piety

28:48.119 --> 28:49.680
would be to return Grandmother's coffin

28:50.440 --> 28:51.839
to Huaying.

28:52.240 --> 28:57.800
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

28:58.360 --> 29:03.240
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

29:04.560 --> 29:07.000
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

29:08.039 --> 29:08.720
Does it hurt?

29:12.000 --> 29:17.480
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

29:18.600 --> 29:22.440
♪I seek nothing beyond myself♪

29:23.680 --> 29:26.240
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

29:26.240 --> 29:27.200
(Yu Residence)
Madam Yu,

29:27.720 --> 29:29.839
that unfilial daughter of mine

29:29.839 --> 29:30.839
won't let go of the grave relocation.

29:31.240 --> 29:32.759
If I truly return the coffin
to my hometown,

29:32.759 --> 29:33.079
I...

29:33.160 --> 29:35.440
What standing would I have left
in the capital?

29:35.720 --> 29:37.319
Fifth Master, please calm down.

29:37.480 --> 29:38.720
I actually think

29:39.759 --> 29:41.039
this might be an opportunity.

29:42.839 --> 29:43.880
Young Madam Yu.

29:44.880 --> 29:46.799
Thanks to your brilliant idea,

29:47.279 --> 29:49.319
we've completely offended
the Wei family.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.680
The plan failed.

29:51.799 --> 29:52.480
Don't you

29:52.480 --> 29:54.119
owe us

29:54.119 --> 29:55.559
a clear explanation?

29:56.480 --> 29:57.799
Madam Wu, you jest.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.119
Aren't these things

29:59.240 --> 30:00.680
what you wanted to do as well?

30:01.119 --> 30:02.119
After all,

30:02.119 --> 30:03.799
it was your idea.

30:09.319 --> 30:10.079
How about this?

30:10.599 --> 30:11.599
You do me a favor.

30:13.359 --> 30:14.759
I'll be sure to help you.

30:16.279 --> 30:17.079
What do you mean?

30:17.880 --> 30:18.920
I recall

30:19.200 --> 30:20.400
you are an Anzhou merchant.

30:21.599 --> 30:23.440
The silks and stationery

30:23.440 --> 30:24.640
you supply to the Xie shop,

30:25.240 --> 30:26.680
surely you could mix in
some inferior goods

30:27.039 --> 30:28.240
without much trouble?

30:28.559 --> 30:30.799
You want to ruin the Xie shop's
reputation.

30:35.240 --> 30:38.039
You want to use my hand as your blade

30:39.359 --> 30:41.119
to settle your grudge against Miss Xie.

30:42.119 --> 30:44.200
But if things go wrong,

30:44.200 --> 30:45.119
who takes the blame?

30:45.720 --> 30:47.319
I will protect you when the time comes.

30:48.200 --> 30:48.960
Rest assured.

30:50.079 --> 30:52.240
I am deeply favored by Madam Yu now.

30:53.400 --> 30:54.519
Her heart

30:55.759 --> 30:57.319
is with me as well.

30:58.640 --> 31:00.680
Young Madam, you don't actually believe

31:01.039 --> 31:03.160
that with one word,

31:03.160 --> 31:05.319
I should run errands for you

31:05.319 --> 31:06.599
and be grateful for the honor?

31:07.359 --> 31:08.920
I see clearly now.

31:09.440 --> 31:10.920
You've climbed high.

31:10.920 --> 31:13.519
You haven't learned the arts
of a high-born lady,

31:13.839 --> 31:15.440
but you've certainly picked up

31:15.720 --> 31:17.640
the airs of one.

31:17.640 --> 31:19.559
How dare you speak
to Young Madam like that?

31:24.079 --> 31:25.720
Everyone has

31:25.720 --> 31:26.680
their own ways.

31:27.039 --> 31:29.319
If I had no tricks of my own,

31:29.480 --> 31:31.119
I wouldn't have come to the capital

31:31.119 --> 31:32.519
alone to make a show of myself.

31:33.359 --> 31:34.240
Young Madam.

31:34.240 --> 31:35.400
You rely on the Yu family.

31:35.400 --> 31:36.400
Why don't you guess

31:36.480 --> 31:37.920
who I can rely on?

31:41.160 --> 31:41.880
Farewell.

31:50.240 --> 31:51.000
Madam.

31:51.599 --> 31:53.039
Madam Wu is here to see you.

31:53.440 --> 31:54.279
Send her away.

31:55.160 --> 31:56.400
Too many eyes and ears.

31:56.839 --> 31:58.559
These distant relatives

31:58.559 --> 31:59.799
always come to bother us.

32:01.160 --> 32:01.920
Madam.

32:01.920 --> 32:02.680
- She...
- Madam Wu.

32:02.680 --> 32:03.319
You cannot go in.

32:03.319 --> 32:03.839
Madam Wu.

32:03.839 --> 32:04.319
Madam Wu.

32:04.319 --> 32:04.880
Madam.

32:10.440 --> 32:11.200
Madam Yu.

32:11.680 --> 32:12.519
Madam Wu.

32:12.640 --> 32:13.759
How have you been lately?

32:14.039 --> 32:15.240
I appreciate your concern.

32:15.240 --> 32:16.480
I have managed to settle in for now.

32:17.200 --> 32:18.039
However,

32:18.279 --> 32:19.480
does your daughter-in-law

32:20.160 --> 32:21.720
truly take me for some poor relative

32:21.720 --> 32:23.799
who came to sponge off you?

32:32.079 --> 32:33.759
I suppose I was too humble,

32:34.359 --> 32:35.480
and made a fool of myself.

32:36.279 --> 32:36.640
No...

32:42.640 --> 32:43.680
The world

32:43.680 --> 32:44.720
is full of all kinds of people.

32:44.720 --> 32:46.039
Each has their own way of life,

32:46.440 --> 32:48.039
each hides their own cards.

32:48.400 --> 32:49.680
Take Madam Wei, for example.

32:49.680 --> 32:51.319
She relies on her own family,
not her in-laws.

32:51.759 --> 32:53.079
And Miss Xie

32:53.319 --> 32:55.160
relies on experience and courage.

32:55.480 --> 32:56.440
You, Madam,

32:56.440 --> 32:57.440
have mastered

32:57.440 --> 32:59.319
the skill of strategic planning.

33:00.039 --> 33:02.519
Even the Young Madam,
though less experienced,

33:02.519 --> 33:03.880
has the Yu family behind her.

33:05.559 --> 33:07.359
I have no great learning,

33:07.720 --> 33:08.759
and my husband

33:08.759 --> 33:10.000
is only a merchant.

33:10.279 --> 33:11.559
But I do benefit

33:12.000 --> 33:13.960
from a bit of ancestral grace.

33:18.200 --> 33:19.720
Three generations back,

33:20.119 --> 33:21.640
my great-grandmother had the fortune

33:21.759 --> 33:24.119
to be a wet nurse to a noble personage.

33:25.759 --> 33:27.359
Who might that be?

33:27.599 --> 33:29.079
She sits in the palace.

33:29.079 --> 33:30.240
The Grand Empress Dowager.

33:37.359 --> 33:39.079
Our dynasty rules by filial piety.

33:39.799 --> 33:42.200
The Grand Empress Dowager values
filial piety above all.

33:42.799 --> 33:44.799
In gratitude
for my great-grandmother's care,

33:44.799 --> 33:47.039
she invites our entire family
to celebrate each year.

33:47.240 --> 33:47.799
And so,

33:48.079 --> 33:50.359
with her birthday banquet approaching,

33:51.119 --> 33:53.720
every notable figure in the capital

33:54.000 --> 33:55.400
will be in attendance.

33:57.920 --> 33:59.119
Sometimes,

33:59.119 --> 34:01.319
just a few words with a noble person

34:01.759 --> 34:03.480
(Invitation to the Longevity Banquet)
can be extremely useful.

34:08.000 --> 34:09.400
My daughter-in-law

34:09.559 --> 34:11.000
has always been rather thoughtless.

34:11.079 --> 34:12.000
Madam Wu,

34:12.199 --> 34:13.920
please don't hold it
against the younger generation.

34:13.920 --> 34:15.400
We are still relatives.

34:16.199 --> 34:16.800
Please.

34:22.400 --> 34:23.840
But after all,

34:23.840 --> 34:25.239
we are only distant relatives.

34:25.800 --> 34:28.000
I traveled a long way to bring my niece

34:28.000 --> 34:29.559
to the capital,

34:29.639 --> 34:30.519
all

34:30.760 --> 34:33.519
for the sake of family ties.

34:36.800 --> 34:37.760
Madam Wu,

34:37.760 --> 34:39.239
you wish to find a good match

34:39.400 --> 34:40.760
for your niece.

34:41.280 --> 34:42.320
I understand.

34:45.920 --> 34:47.079
Then thank you, Madam.

35:01.240 --> 35:04.640
(Rosy in the Evening Glow)

35:06.920 --> 35:09.000
Isn't this just what I needed?

35:09.280 --> 35:10.480
What perfect timing.

35:10.800 --> 35:13.840
This time, I will teach
the Ninth Young Lady a proper lesson.

35:14.639 --> 35:16.360
For a family like ours,

35:16.639 --> 35:18.840
having good information is essential.

35:26.079 --> 35:27.119
In three days,

35:27.119 --> 35:28.400
my grandmother's birthday banquet
will be held.

35:28.480 --> 35:29.320
By then,

35:29.320 --> 35:31.360
Huchen, you and Miss Xie
will also attend.

35:32.079 --> 35:33.039
I hereby

35:33.039 --> 35:34.440
congratulate you

35:34.599 --> 35:36.000
on the happy occasion ahead.

35:36.719 --> 35:38.280
Now that you have parental consent,

35:38.519 --> 35:40.280
a proper matchmaker is also important.

35:40.920 --> 35:41.719
When the time comes,

35:41.719 --> 35:42.639
I will personally

35:42.719 --> 35:43.800
add my blessing.

35:44.559 --> 35:45.719
His Majesty personally...

35:46.440 --> 35:47.039
I,

35:47.800 --> 35:49.199
thank Your Majesty
for your immense grace.

36:09.639 --> 36:10.400
Mr. Zhao.

36:14.960 --> 36:16.559
Your banquet outfit
for the Grand Empress Dowager

36:16.840 --> 36:17.960
is ready for you.

36:18.800 --> 36:19.719
See if you like it.

36:55.960 --> 36:56.800
What do you think?

37:09.639 --> 37:10.920
Is it proper?

37:13.280 --> 37:15.079
I still think you looked better
in your wedding attire.

37:30.040 --> 37:33.200
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

38:00.800 --> 38:01.599
Greetings,

38:01.599 --> 38:03.079
Your Majesty.

38:03.679 --> 38:05.119
May Your Majesty

38:05.119 --> 38:07.199
live long and prosper.

38:07.360 --> 38:08.320
(Grand Empress Dowager)
Rise.

38:09.519 --> 38:10.880
Thank you, Your Majesty.

38:13.199 --> 38:14.360
Come to think of it,

38:14.760 --> 38:16.519
your great-grandmother once

38:16.760 --> 38:19.320
nursed me for three days.

38:19.559 --> 38:21.079
That bond,

38:21.480 --> 38:23.079
I have not forgotten.

38:25.239 --> 38:26.800
Your Majesty is too kind.

38:27.039 --> 38:29.320
That my great-grandmother had the honor
to serve you for those days

38:29.440 --> 38:31.360
was a blessing earned
over many lifetimes.

38:31.800 --> 38:33.199
Even the ancestral graves were blessed.

38:36.679 --> 38:38.440
Were it not for your grace,

38:38.679 --> 38:39.400
I

38:39.480 --> 38:41.280
would never have enjoyed such fortune.

38:43.320 --> 38:44.280
Rise.

38:44.480 --> 38:45.800
Thank you, Your Majesty.

38:48.199 --> 38:49.679
These days,

38:49.760 --> 38:52.239
people who remember old bonds like you

38:52.239 --> 38:53.360
are rare.

38:54.400 --> 38:56.079
You have traveled far and wide

38:56.199 --> 38:57.599
and seen many things.

38:57.840 --> 38:59.199
Tell me,

38:59.920 --> 39:00.880
what news

39:00.880 --> 39:02.960
is there from beyond these walls?

39:03.639 --> 39:04.480
Recently,

39:05.000 --> 39:06.639
there is something quite curious.

39:08.280 --> 39:10.039
A young lady by the name of Xie

39:10.280 --> 39:12.400
wants to relocate the grave
of Old Madam Fu.

39:14.000 --> 39:15.400
This Miss Xie...

39:15.400 --> 39:17.840
Why would she move a Fu family grave?

39:18.519 --> 39:20.840
This matter is tied to a case

39:21.159 --> 39:22.280
that was just heard

39:22.280 --> 39:23.440
at the Chengqian Prefecture.

39:28.760 --> 39:31.360
=Next Episode=

39:31.840 --> 39:32.840
(I)

39:33.079 --> 39:35.280
(pledge the fortune of this life
and the next)

39:35.599 --> 39:37.159
(in exchange for my daughter Tingyun's)

39:37.239 --> 39:38.679
(marital bliss)

39:38.679 --> 39:40.119
(and a life free of hardship.)

39:40.760 --> 39:43.320
You want your mother
to attend your wedding?

39:43.400 --> 39:44.679
In your dreams!

39:45.079 --> 39:46.800
You will not see your mother!

39:46.800 --> 39:47.639
And I said so!

39:47.639 --> 39:48.719
You won't see her!

39:49.280 --> 39:49.560
(Fu Residence)

39:51.000 --> 39:51.559
Zhao Ling!

39:52.079 --> 39:52.800
You bandit.

39:52.800 --> 39:53.760
You wastrel!

39:54.000 --> 39:55.000
As a fourth-rank official,

39:55.639 --> 39:56.360
you...

39:56.360 --> 39:57.400
break the law you serve.

39:57.400 --> 39:58.559
If you dare take one more step,

39:59.119 --> 40:00.039
I'll shoot you!

40:00.360 --> 40:01.119
Come on!

40:14.921 --> 40:19.241
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

40:22.841 --> 40:27.201
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

40:29.321 --> 40:33.961
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

40:34.201 --> 40:37.001
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

40:38.161 --> 40:42.801
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

40:46.001 --> 40:52.841
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

40:53.721 --> 41:00.241
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:01.201 --> 41:04.641
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:05.161 --> 41:09.361
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:09.641 --> 41:15.321
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

41:27.441 --> 41:31.321
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

41:35.241 --> 41:39.241
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

41:40.961 --> 41:45.641
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

41:45.961 --> 41:48.641
♪Kept close within my heart♪

41:49.721 --> 41:54.561
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

41:58.081 --> 42:05.001
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:05.881 --> 42:12.361
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

42:13.241 --> 42:16.761
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:17.201 --> 42:21.561
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:21.761 --> 42:27.481
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
